{title: Tu Pyar Ka Sagar Hai}
{artist: Manna Dey Shankar Jaikishan}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Tu pyaar ka saagar hai
[Am]Teri ek boond [D]ke pyaase hum
[Em]Lauta jo diya tune
[Am]Chale jaayenge [D]jahaan se hum
[Em]Ghaayal [Am]mann ka [Em]paagal panchhi
[D]Udne [Em]ko beqaraar
[Em]Pankh hai [Am]komal aankh [Em]hai dhundli
[D]Jaana hai [Em]saagar paar
[Am]Jaana hai [Em]saagar paar
[Em]Ab tu hi isse samjha
[Am]Raah bhoole the [D]kahan se hum
[Em]Idhar [Am]jhoom ke [Em]gaaye zindagi
[D]Udhar hai [Em]maut khadi
[Em]Koi kya [Am]jaane kahaan [Em]hai seema
[D]Uljhan [Em]aan padi
[Am]Uljhan [Em]aan padi
[Em]Kaanon mein zara keh de
[Am]Ke aaye kaun [D]disha se hum
